      "location": "crates/oo-cli/src/load.rs read_capped and inspect",
      "prior": "a103 findings.json status open on commit 3347f5a280da52c70525879b4608170b6b92b523",
      "expected": "Token, SQL, and CA paths open with O_NONBLOCK and O_NOFOLLOW on the same descriptor, then fstat. A FIFO returns the static not-file error with no signal, empty stdout, and zero listener accepts, before any read or connect. Token exits 4. SQL and CA exit 1. A killed child is never exit 1 success.",
      "actual": "Commit 7acca207 sets custom_flags(O_NOFOLLOW | O_NONBLOCK) before open, then File::metadata. Peerless and writer-held token, SQL, and CA FIFOs returned in 10-13 ms with the exact static not-file text, empty stdout, signal none, and zero accepts. Request timeout was 120000 ms and the reject deadline was 1200 ms.",
